"<br>"
"<br><i>Example:</i> site readd"
"<br>"
"<br>This will show a list of users that can be readded."
"<br>(You can also achieve this with \"site users deleted\")"
"<br>"
"<br><i>Example:</i> site readd Archimede"
"<br>"
"<br>This will remove the DELETED flag for user 'Archimede'."
